<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Invalid ID</title>
    <style>
    /* Standalone page: it never loads style.css, so the tokens are restated
       here rather than referenced. It used to hardcode a light palette only,
       which meant a dark-mode visitor got a white card in the middle of an
       otherwise dark session. */
    :root {
      --bg: #f8f9fa;
      --card-bg: white;
      --text: #333;
      --link: #0b5ed7;
      --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #1f1f1f;
        --card-bg: #2c2c2c;
        --text: #e0e0e0;
        --link: #7ab3ff;
        --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .error-container {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 3rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px var(--shadow);
      max-width: 500px;
      width: 90%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .error-emoji {
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .error-title {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .error-message {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .error-home-link a {
      color: var(--link);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .error-home-link a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="error-container">
      <div class="error-emoji">🔥🥒🔥</div>
      <h1 class="error-title">Invalid ID</h1>
      <p class="error-message">
        <p>잘못된 ID 형식입니다.</p>
        <p>無効なIDフォーマットです。</p>
        <p>无效的ID格式。</p>
        <p>The URL you're looking for contains an invalid ID format.</p>
      </p>
      <p class="error-home-link">
        <a href="/">← Go back to home</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
